# The #524 study is closed and its machinery was deleted at closure. What remains here is
# ORPHANED LOCAL OUTPUT on machines that ran the study: nothing generates it any more, and
# nothing reads it. It is ignored rather than committed because `results/` alone is ~166 MB,
# and a `git add -A` in a worktree that still holds it would otherwise commit 1.4M lines.
#
# Delete this file once the local directories below are gone; a fresh clone never has them.
results/
holdout/cache/
holdout/pool.json
holdout2/cache/
confounder/population.json
nearfull/population.json
